      "a": "Oregon received $2.1B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Total award count was 10,683 and the average award size was $198K. Obligations were up 1.7% year over year. Historical annual obligations were $1.8B in FY21, $1.9B in FY22, $2.5B in FY23, $2.4B in FY24, and $2.1B in FY25."
